{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"差し入れのアイス*°"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5Z3M57PZQZ3AT0TMKY0A3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nアイス久しぶり.ﾟ･*."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコ系かチーズケーキ系が好きです。あと、キャラメルとかバナナ系。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近暑いので、アイスはすごく幸せです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はロッキーロードをたべました!\nマシュマロが入っていてとってもおいしかったです❁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイスは毎日食べたいくらい好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は、\nばかうけのごま揚げ醤油 が好きです。\nあと、ぬれせんべい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポテトチップスのしあわせバタ〜も。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お菓子は我慢しなきゃ、と葛藤してる毎日です。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5Z4M7S7QF998BXNAEV65E","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nむむ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい匂いの。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5Z5HQWTCHYNHAQKPB1EJJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n爽やかな匂い。\nフルーツの匂いが好きです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アップ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5Z6ED7E3NQGRYJWBJX0X9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}